From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:56:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/17] test-posix: Check ffs, ffsl, ffsll and strcasecmp_l

Every bit position and the sign bit for ffs, ffsl and ffsll; and the
case-insensitive comparisons in the POSIX locale, lowercase before
comparing, with and without a locale argument.
---
